      "filename": "Colourful cooling towers of the decommisioned Orlando Power Station (4612453602).jpg",
      "title": "File:Colourful cooling towers of the decommisioned Orlando Power Station (4612453602).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/Colourful_cooling_towers_of_the_decommisioned_Orlando_Power_Station_%284612453602%29.jpg",
